fetch.schema:
tool: fetch — fetch a URL as readable text
Downloads a web page and returns its text: title, paragraphs, links, and code blocks. Use for docs, references, and code help online. Binary files are refused; long pages truncate with a marker.
Native call example:
```json
{"name": "fetch", "arguments": {
  "url": "<url>"
}}
```
slots:
  url (string, required): the http(s) URL to fetch

